        "content": "<p>I'm thinking about how to implement something like Python's <code>asyncio</code> in Lean. Following its design, I decide to first try to implement something like a generator function.</p>\n<p>My current design is to have a monad <code>M In Out</code> representing a type of \"program\" that can yield values of type <code>Out</code> or take values of type <code>In</code>. (Python-style.)</p>\n<p>An example follows. Explanation:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>M In Out</code> is the monad.</li>\n<li><code>run</code> is the implementation, written in an imperative style (as expected). Because of the <code>while</code> loop, we cannot prove things about it, but this issue is rather minor.</li>\n<li>The main feature of this monad <code>M</code> is programs can yield values of type <code>Out</code> during its execution, and resume execution upon receiving a value of type <code>In</code>. It can also choose to not yield anything and return a result of type <code>α</code>.</li>\n<li><code>callerCheck</code> is its invoker. We can see the <code>#eval</code> returns <code>true</code> for it.</li>\n<li>The rest is the implementation of <code>M</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">In</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Out</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yield</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">resume</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">In</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">In</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Out</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">out</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Out</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">In</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Out</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">program</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">In</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Out</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">next</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">In</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Out</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">In</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Out</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">program</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">yield</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">resume</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">out</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">yield</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">resume</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">next</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">out</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">next</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Monad</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">In</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Out</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">pure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">return</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">bind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bind</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yield</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">out</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Out</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">In</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Out</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">In</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">yield</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">out</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">while</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yield</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sum</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">callerCheck</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Id</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">yield</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">resume</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">yield</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">resume</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">resume</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">yield</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">15</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">resume</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">callerCheck</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Questions…</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Am I missing some good practice in the code above?</li>\n<li>Am I reinventing some wheel? I looked into <code>ForM</code> and the iterator interface, but it doesn't look possible to send values inside the iteration. (Looking at the async interface of Lean, looks like only the one based on <code>IO.Task</code> is supported)</li>\n</ul>",
        "id": 634618827,
